{"3892520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Claire Detective 1 : The Monster of Flavoria Lake", "steam_appid": 3892520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4794790], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the role of Claire, a young detective looking to make a name for herself 🔎 ! Solve the intriguing <i>mystery</i> of Flavoria lake and its enigmatic <strong>monster</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask the <i>wacky</i> characters <i>nosy questions</i> and help them get to the bottom of your investigation !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/83fd408e3a51ab0d26c563b3f1aff8ce.avif?t=1780985368\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️WARNING⚠️: This is a short game ! Expect to play for an hour or so !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/f898e793f06ce71831b6e61d0a990806.avif?t=1780985368\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tourist took a <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">super-blurry</span></i> photo of a monster at Flavoria lake ! While <i>geeks</i> argue on <i>Reddot</i> about whether it's a <i>fake</i> or not, enthusiasts from all over the region are rushing to find this <i>famous</i> creature !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your detective career a boost and prove to everyone that this monster exists !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have the courage to face the <i>mosquitoes</i> 🦟 ?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you could earn some <i>money</i> in the process... that would be great !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/698f803ef0782458da28d188cd3389e2.avif?t=1780985368\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game with a <i>hint(lol)</i> of platforming too !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You'll have a great time :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking simulator with a bit of platform 🤏</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Funny</i> dialogues 🤡</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A talking penguin hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old dog🐶 shamelessly ripping you off with a <i>jPhone 18</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking aquatic exploration 🫧 <i>(no)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be a <i>monster</i> underwater</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the role of Claire, a young detective looking to make a name for herself 🔎 ! Solve the intriguing <i>mystery</i> of Flavoria lake and its enigmatic <strong>monster</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask the <i>wacky</i> characters <i>nosy questions</i> and help them get to the bottom of your investigation !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/83fd408e3a51ab0d26c563b3f1aff8ce.avif?t=1780985368\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️WARNING⚠️: This is a short game ! Expect to play for an hour or so !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/f898e793f06ce71831b6e61d0a990806.avif?t=1780985368\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tourist took a <i><span class=\"bb_strike\">super-blurry</span></i> photo of a monster at Flavoria lake ! While <i>geeks</i> argue on <i>Reddot</i> about whether it's a <i>fake</i> or not, enthusiasts from all over the region are rushing to find this <i>famous</i> creature !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your detective career a boost and prove to everyone that this monster exists !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have the courage to face the <i>mosquitoes</i> 🦟 ?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you could earn some <i>money</i> in the process... that would be great !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/extras/698f803ef0782458da28d188cd3389e2.avif?t=1780985368\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventure game with a <i>hint(lol)</i> of platforming too !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You'll have a great time :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking simulator with a bit of platform 🤏</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Funny</i> dialogues 🤡</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A talking penguin hat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old dog🐶 shamelessly ripping you off with a <i>jPhone 18</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking aquatic exploration 🫧 <i>(no)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be a <i>monster</i> underwater</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A monster has been spotted at Flavoria lake ! Hoax or truth ? Start your detective career with panache by solving this mystery... not so complicated... but hey ! First time for everything, right ?", "supported_languages": "English, French", "reviews": "“I just wanted to take a selfie!”<br />\r\n5/5 – The tourist<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892520/d45408528289b197bfd5814ccba37fa489b70480/header.jpg?t=1780985368", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstati